                  "text": "Isa 6:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man hekalu pong’ ku yiro m’uai ba dwong’ pa Mungu, man ba tego pare; man ng’atu moko mbe ma copo mondo i hekalu, ma fodi masendi abiro mi malaika abiro ku thum ungo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.8",
